      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only what's needed to respond to your inspection or service request: your name, property address, phone number, email, and whatever you tell us about the roof. If you upload photos with your request, we store those too.</p>

      <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
      <p>We don't run tracking pixels, heatmaps, session recorders, or fingerprinting scripts. No Facebook pixel. No Google Ads remarketing. No Hotjar. Our analytics is Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookie-free and aggregates page views without identifying individuals.</p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To call or email you back about your inspection or service request.</li>
        <li>To schedule and confirm appointments.</li>
        <li>To coordinate with your insurance adjuster (only if you've explicitly asked us to).</li>
        <li>To send you a written estimate and, later, an invoice.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>That's it. We don't email newsletters, we don't retarget, we don't sell data to anyone, and we don't share your info with other contractors or companies.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Completed job records are kept for seven years for warranty and tax purposes. If we spoke to you but never did work, we purge your info after 90 days.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy of what we have on file about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:privacy@redcaproofing.example">privacy@redcaproofing.example</a> or call <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a> and ask for Claire.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The only cookies this site sets are strictly necessary ones for the contact form's anti-spam protection. No advertising, no analytics, no third-party cookies.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Redcap Roofing, 2100 N. Circle Drive, Colorado Springs, CO 80909. Phone (928) 315-9094. Email <a href="mailto:privacy@redcaproofing.example">privacy@redcaproofing.example</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
